<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ridley buys stockfeed producer.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ridley buys stockfeed producer.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockfeed manufacturer Ridley Corp Ltd said on Wednesday it had agreed to buy the stockfeed interests of Victorian producer Maffra Super and Grain Supplies.</p>
<p>&quot;This acquisition reflects the company's ongoing strategy to expand Ridley AgriProducts' feedmilling network within Australia,&quot; chief executive Gary Busenshut said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Maffra feedmill is in an established and growing dairy area and has the capacity to produce 40,000 tonnes a year of pelleted feeds, Busenshut said.</p>
<p>The purchase will be financed by existing banking facilities and should be completed in December this year, he said.</p>
</text>
